\newlabel{fig:ligolaserchapterwatercoolingschematic}{{4.8}{27}{Cartoons of water cooling layouts for the prototype layout. Panel (a): The laser will be run with the amplifier heads cooled in series with each other to reduce jitter. Panel (b): To perform the amplifier head temperature experiment, the water cooling was arranged so that the amplifiers temperature could be independently controlled.\relax }{figure.caption.28}{}}
