\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4.21}{\ignorespaces The four relative pointing noise degrees of freedom for the beam into the PMC was measured with the DBB. The requirement \cite  {PSL_pointing_requirement} is shown in light blue. The pointing noise is above the requirement, however the TnT lab has a higher amount of environmental noise; this pointing noise will be less in the PSL. Measurements below 100\tmspace  +\thinmuskip {.1667em}Hz may be affected by scattering.\relax }}{53}{figure.caption.61}}
